# Realistic Uncertainty Scenario: Ad Hoc Rules in CulinaryControlEnv.place_delivery_order

## Uncertainty Manifestation: Delivery Address ZIP Code Format Requirements

**Description**:
The API function requires delivery address ZIP codes to follow a specific format that combines the standard 5-digit ZIP code with a special suffix indicating the delivery zone. The ZIP code must be formatted as "NNNNN-ZN" where NNNNN is the standard 5-digit ZIP code and ZN is a single-letter zone code (A-F) followed by a numeric subzone (1-9). This non-standard format is required for all delivery orders but is not clearly explained in the documentation.

